NOTE ON THE PREBUILT DRIVER BUNDLE

The driver binary in prebuilt/ifd-ez.bundle is a compiled build of the ezIFD
project (https://github.com/drinkcat/ezIFD), itself a fork of CCID by Ludovic
Rousseau (https://github.com/LudovicRousseau/CCID). That code is licensed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1). The prebuilt
bundle is distributed under those same terms; the full license text is in
licenses/LGPL-2.1.txt, and provenance (exact upstream commits, modifications,
and how to obtain or rebuild the corresponding source) is documented in
NOTICE.md. The MIT license above applies to the packaging in this repository
(scripts, documentation, installer), not to the driver binary.
